  "arrangerNotes": "Right-hand melody of the first section (bars 1–16) only, verified against the LilyPond score on French Wikipedia. The second section is left out because it modulates (C#, i.e. sharp 4) and the drum has no accidentals. Ornaments are not played: two mordents and the grace note in bar 8 (the score's printed main notes are used). Left hand left out. Tempo slowed from the score's half note = 72. Range low 7 to high 1, minLayout 11 on both drums. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
  "verified": true
}
